#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0229 expect=skipped domain=ADDL
#note "ADSL-vs-ADDL pin: the base rule's Data_Structures block is one token narrower than PMDA-AD0229B's. AD-prefixed name, no BDS indicator, no column ending TERM/TRT/DECOD -> base ADAM OTHER; SPDEVID refines it to DEVICE LEVEL ANALYSIS DATASET, which under Fix #179 has no supertype and is not covered by [SUBJECT LEVEL ANALYSIS DATASET]. Data would fire if it ran; PMDA-AD0229B would run on this very fixture."
#library standard=adamig version=1-0
dataset ADDL
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col SPDEVID type=Char
col TRTSEQA type=Char
col TRTSEQAN type=Num
---
S1 | 001 | DEV01 | A-B | 1
S1 | 002 | DEV01 | A-B | 1
S1 | 003 | DEV02 | B-A | 1
